### ─── PropertyLoop Vendors Endpoints ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Login as vendor
# @name loginVendor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{vendorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{vendorPassword}}"
}

### Login as buyer (for reviews)
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{buyerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}"
}

### ═══ 1. List vendors (public) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors?page=1&limit=10

### ═══ 2. List vendors with filters ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors?category=Plumbing&location=Lekki&sort=top_rated

### ═══ 3. Get own vendor profile ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 4. Update vendor profile ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendors/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Emeka Okonkwo",
  "bio": "Expert plumber with 8 years experience across Lekki and Victoria Island. Specialises in kitchen and bathroom installations.",
  "priceLabel": "From ₦15,000",
  "priceNum": 15000,
  "serviceArea": "Lekki, Ajah, Victoria Island, Ikoyi",
  "portfolioImages": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621905251189-08b45d6a269e?w=600",
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585704032915-c3400ca199e7?w=600"
  ],
  "availableForHire": true
}

### ═══ 5. Get vendor dashboard stats ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors/me/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 6. Get public vendor profile ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors/{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}

### ═══ 7. List vendor reviews ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors/{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}/reviews

### ═══ 8. Create vendor review (as buyer) ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendors/{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Emeka fixed our kitchen sink perfectly. Professional, on time, and fair price. Will use again!",
  "jobTitle": "Kitchen Sink Repair"
}

### ═══ 9. Verify review and updated rating ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors/{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}
